      "benefit": {
        "id": "chiefEngineer",
        "name": "Chief Engineer Role Benefit",
        "description": "You reduce the opportunity cost of engineering teams by 1, to a minimum of 0. Further, when you attempt a task to perform repairs to a starship or attempt to push the ship’s capabilities beyond its normal limits, you may spend 1 Momentum (Immediate) to re-roll a d20.",
